# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# This repo tracks ONLY the durable context: CLAUDE.md and context/.
#
# It is a WHITELIST. Everything is ignored by default, and only the two safe
# paths are re-included. That is deliberate: `keys/`, every `.env`, and both
# `release.keystore` files live under this folder, and a stray `git add -A`
# must never be able to reach them.
#
# The actual projects have their own repos:
#   hlooo/            -> gamepadadmin01-tech/gamepados
#   hlooo/website/    -> gamepadadmin01-tech/gamepad
#   App with login/   -> gamepadadmin01-tech/app-with-login
#   flexsquares/      -> gamepadadmin01-tech/flexspace
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Ignore everything.
/*

# Re-include only these.
!/CLAUDE.md
!/context/
!/.gitignore

# Belt and braces: even inside context/, never allow a secret through.
context/**/*.env
context/**/*.pem
context/**/*.keystore
context/**/*.jks
context/**/*.p12
context/**/secrets/
